# k.genres/shards/email: the genre "email": 5 parts in order with how many times each occurs, and 7 steps (the moves of each part in order, with alternatives and sentence counts).
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository: tools/genres-core.mjs; the works cited are in WORLD.md)
